    "text": "Sindon \u00fery dagas on twelf mon\u00f0um, \u00fea syndon swi\u00f0e unhalwende men o\u00f0\u00f0e nytenum blod to forl\u00e6tenne\n\u00de\u00e6t is se \u00e6ftemesta monand\u00e6ig on Aprilis, \u00e6r he gange of tune, and se forma monand\u00e6g on\nSe\u00f0e on \u00f0am \u00ferim monandagum mannum o\u00f0\u00f0e nytene blod forl\u00e6te\u00f0 \u00e6r feowerteo\u00f0an d\u00e6ge he sceal\nAnd gif he drenc drinc\u00f0 to l\u00e6cecr\u00e6fte, \u00e6r fiftene dagan he sceal swyltan.\nAnd gif hwilc man acenned by\u00f0 on \u00feysum \u00ferim dagum, he sceal swyltan yfelan dea\u00f0e.\nAnd se\u00f0e ete\u00f0 fl\u00e6sc on \u00feysum \u00ferim dagum, he sceal swyltan \u00e6r feowertugum dagum.",
